---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Closing from '../components/Closing.astro';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import EditorialImage from '../components/EditorialImage.astro';
import { equipment } from '../data/services';
import { faqGroups } from '../data/faq';
---
<Layout active="studio" title="The Private Studio in Larkspur, Colorado" description="A private Pilates studio in a quiet property setting in Larkspur, Colorado. Professional equipment, personal instruction, and visits by appointment.">
  <section class="text-hero studio-hero wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">The studio / Larkspur, Colorado</p><h1>Space to focus.<br /><em>Room to move.</em></h1><div class="text-hero-bottom"><p>A quiet, private property setting.<br />Your appointment. Your attention.</p><span class="eyebrow">By appointment only</span></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section editorial-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A different kind of studio</p><h2>Personal<br /><em>by design.</em></h2></div><div class="prose"><p>There is something valuable about having room to pay attention. The private studio in Larkspur offers a quiet setting for focused, individual instruction.</p><p>Professional Pilates equipment supports a range of movement experiences. Sessions are planned around the individual, with time to learn, ask questions, and work at an appropriate pace.</p><p>The Colorado property setting is part of the experience: natural surroundings and a private appointment, close to the work at hand.</p></div></section>
  <div class="wide-figure wrap"><EditorialImage slot="studio-wide" class="wide-image" sizes="90vw" /></div>
  <section class="sage-section"><div class="wrap section editorial-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Inside the studio</p><h2>Equipped<br /><em>for intention.</em></h2></div><ul class="plain-list">{equipment.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section editorial-split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Planning your visit</p><h2>Find us<br /><em>in Larkspur.</em></h2><EditorialImage slot="property-landscape" class="split-image" sizes="(max-width: 1023px) 90vw, 35vw" /></div><div class="prose"><p>Visits are by appointment. Exact directions are provided to confirmed clients, so your arrival can be planned in advance.</p><p>For equine and Horse + Rider appointments, confirm the session location, horse participation, and facilities with Stephanie before arranging transport.</p><p class="fine-print">This is a private residential property. The exact address is shared only with confirmed clients.</p></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you arrive</p><h2>Your visit, considered.</h2></div><Faq items={faqGroups[3].items} /></section>
  <Closing />
</Layout>
